  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/W5NORTN9/images/24fe425be28631c6acb121e1ef37c57f5a421870.png\" alt=\"血之魔典：重生\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood-rebirth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/911546?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=f16436\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftome-of-blood-rebirth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/W5NORTN9?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=1bd96a\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/743298050222587978?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=404eed\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-LGPL v3-blue.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"授權條款: LGPL v3\"></a></p><p>為<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>\n與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood Magic</a>之間新增相容性，以新法術書和裝備的形式呈現！</p><h3>功能特色：</h3><ul>\n<li>血之魔典 - 使用LP而非魔力值施法的法術書</li>\n<li>感知傷害符文 - 造成感知傷害並隨惡魔意志量提升效果</li>\n<li>異端護甲 - 融合血魔法活體護甲與Ars Nouveau天賦系統的新護甲</li>\n<li>薄荷茶 - 遊戲前期協助LP生成的物品</li>\n<li>新天賦與活體護甲升級！</li>\n</ul><p>完整功能說明請查閱《破舊筆記本》（Ars Nouveau的Patchouli指南書）中的<code>血之魔典</code>章節</p><h3>授權條款</h3><ul>\n<li>本儲存庫所有程式碼均採用<strong>LGPLv3授權條款</strong>。</li>\n</ul>",
